      "label": "NA East",
      "timeZone": "America/New_York",
      "note": "NA East servers run on New York time, and every event below follows that clock (the local hour stays the same when the clocks go back on November 1). Daily and weekly resets happen at one moment on every Global server, 16:00 Korean time (07:00 UTC): 03:00 New York time, 02:00 from November 1. NCSOFT has not published the Global event times; if one is off on your server, tell us on Discord."
    },
    {
