      "timeZone": "America/Los_Angeles",
      "note": "NA West servers run on Los Angeles (Pacific) time, and every event below follows that clock (the local hour stays the same when the clocks go back on November 1). Daily and weekly resets happen at one moment on every Global server, 16:00 Korean time (07:00 UTC): 00:00 Los Angeles time, then 23:00 the evening before from November 1 (the weekly reset falls on Tuesday night). NCSOFT has not published the Global event times; if one is off on your server, tell us on Discord."
    },
